    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9683555735,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-fd087afe83b2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 1940.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 875.0,
      "seed": 238845,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What You Will See\n| Resource | Snowflake object | What to check\n|\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `snowflake_database`, `snowflake_schema` |\ndatabase, schema | `is_transient` and a\nschema's `database` force replacement. Look\nfor `prevent_destroy`, and for schemas that\ndbt also writes. |\n| `snowflake_warehouse` | warehouse |\n`warehouse_size`, `auto_suspend`,\n`warehouse_type` |\n| `snowflake_account_role`,\n`snowflake_grant_account_role` | role and role\nhierarchy | Is each custom role granted up to\nSYSADMIN? |\n| `snowflake_grant_privileges_to_account_role`\n| privileges | Which of the four kinds of\ngrant? `always_apply`? |\n| `snowflake_grant_ownership` | ownership |\nWhich role owns the objects after the apply? |\n| `snowflake_service_user` | user with `TYPE =\nSERVICE` | Key pair or token, and its network\npolicy |\n| `snowflake_storage_integration_aws`,\n`snowflake_external_volume`,\n`snowflake_notification_integration` |\nintegrations with AWS | Where do the role ARN\nand the external ID come from? |\n| `snowflake_catalog_integration_open_catalog`\n| catalog integration | Where does the OAuth\nsecret come from? |\n| `snowflake_stage_external_s3` | external\nstage | A change of `directory.auto_refresh`\nrecreates the stage. |\n| `snowflake_tag`, `snowflake_tag_association`\n| tag and its use | Each association ID should\nbe unique. |\n| `snowflake_execute` | any SQL | Do `execute`\nand `revert` match? Any secrets? |\n\nThree older resources are deprecated:\n`snowflake_stage`,\n`snowflake_storage_integration` and\n`snowflake_file_format` ([deprecated resources\n](https://github.com/snowflakedb/terraform-pro\nvider-snowflake/blob/v2.23.0/docs/index.md#L98\n9-L995)). Typed resources, such as\n`snowflake_stage_external_s3`, replace the\nfirst two.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-fd087afe83b2",
      "originalText": "What You Will See\n| Resource | Snowflake object | What to check |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `snowflake_database`, `snowflake_schema` | database, schema | `is_transient` and a schema's `database` force replacement. Look for `prevent_destroy`, and for schemas that dbt also writes. |\n| `snowflake_warehouse` | warehouse | `warehouse_size`, `auto_suspend`, `warehouse_type` |\n| `snowflake_account_role`, `snowflake_grant_account_role` | role and role hierarchy | Is each custom role granted up to SYSADMIN? |\n| `snowflake_grant_privileges_to_account_role` | privileges | Which of the four kinds of grant? `always_apply`? |\n| `snowflake_grant_ownership` | ownership | Which role owns the objects after the apply? |\n| `snowflake_service_user` | user with `TYPE = SERVICE` | Key pair or token, and its network policy |\n| `snowflake_storage_integration_aws`, `snowflake_external_volume`, `snowflake_notification_integration` | integrations with AWS | Where do the role ARN and the external ID come from? |\n| `snowflake_catalog_integration_open_catalog` | catalog integration | Where does the OAuth secret come from? |\n| `snowflake_stage_external_s3` | external stage | A change of `directory.auto_refresh` recreates the stage. |\n| `snowflake_tag`, `snowflake_tag_association` | tag and its use | Each association ID should be unique. |\n| `snowflake_execute` | any SQL | Do `execute` and `revert` match? Any secrets? |\n\nThree older resources are deprecated: `snowflake_stage`, `snowflake_storage_integration` and `snowflake_file_format` ([deprecated resources](https://github.com/snowflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/blob/v2.23.0/docs/index.md#L989-L995)). Typed resources, such as `snowflake_stage_external_s3`, replace the first two.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "snowflake-what-you-will-see"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8004933563,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-d44e27aa66cc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1309.2,
      "y": 2200.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
      "seed": 135369,
      "groupIds": [],
