    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8018081975,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-4404ce68408e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1940.8,
      "y": 3252.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 192.5,
      "seed": 120332,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Secrets in SQL Text\nThe provider does not mark `execute`,\n`revert`, `query` or `query_results` as\nsensitive ([sensitive values](https://github.c\nom/snowflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/bl\nob/v2.23.0/docs/resources/execute.md#L14)). A\nsecret inside the SQL is stored in the state\nin plain text. If the secret comes from a\nsensitive variable, Terraform hides the whole\nstring, and reviewers see `(sensitive value)`\ninstead of the SQL change.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-4404ce68408e",
      "originalText": "Secrets in SQL Text\nThe provider does not mark `execute`, `revert`, `query` or `query_results` as sensitive ([sensitive values](https://github.com/snowflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/blob/v2.23.0/docs/resources/execute.md#L14)). A secret inside the SQL is stored in the state in plain text. If the secret comes from a sensitive variable, Terraform hides the whole string, and reviewers see `(sensitive value)` instead of the SQL change.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "execute-secrets-in-sql"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
