    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4162588853,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-aa768a01f4c3",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1932.4,
      "y": 4016.5,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 315.0,
      "seed": 562731,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Renamed Grants Race\nA new address for a grant, for example a new\n`for_each` key, plans a destroy at the old\naddress and a create at the new one. Terraform\nruns both at the same time, so the old\n`REVOKE` can land after the new `GRANT` and\nremove it ([issue 3826](https://github.com/sno\nwflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/issues/3\n826)). A `moved` block avoids the race. A\n`moved` block cannot cross resource types in\nthis provider. For a change of type, use\n`removed { lifecycle { destroy = false } }`\nand an `import` ([known issues](https://github\n.com/snowflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/\nblob/v2.23.0/KNOWN_ISSUES.md#L31-L37);\n[migration guide](https://github.com/snowflake\ndb/terraform-provider-snowflake/blob/v2.23.0/d\nocs/guides/resource_migration.md#L33-L54)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-aa768a01f4c3",
      "originalText": "Renamed Grants Race\nA new address for a grant, for example a new `for_each` key, plans a destroy at the old address and a create at the new one. Terraform runs both at the same time, so the old `REVOKE` can land after the new `GRANT` and remove it ([issue 3826](https://github.com/snowflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/issues/3826)). A `moved` block avoids the race. A `moved` block cannot cross resource types in this provider. For a change of type, use `removed { lifecycle { destroy = false } }` and an `import` ([known issues](https://github.com/snowflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/blob/v2.23.0/KNOWN_ISSUES.md#L31-L37); [migration guide](https://github.com/snowflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/blob/v2.23.0/docs/guides/resource_migration.md#L33-L54)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "renamed-grants-race"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
