    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3968244318,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-4d372a09cf1f",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1932.4,
      "y": 4288.5,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 192.5,
      "seed": 419098,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Grants on Unmanaged Objects\nA grant can target an object that Terraform\ndoes not manage. If that object disappears,\nthe refresh drops the grant from state with a\nwarning, and the next plan creates it again.\nDestroying such a grant failed with \"does not\nexist or not authorized\" until the experiment\n`GRANTS_SAFE_DESTROY` became the default in\n2.22.0 ([safe destroy](https://github.com/snow\nflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/blob/v2.2\n3.0/docs/index.md#L1209-L1220)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-4d372a09cf1f",
      "originalText": "Grants on Unmanaged Objects\nA grant can target an object that Terraform does not manage. If that object disappears, the refresh drops the grant from state with a warning, and the next plan creates it again. Destroying such a grant failed with \"does not exist or not authorized\" until the experiment `GRANTS_SAFE_DESTROY` became the default in 2.22.0 ([safe destroy](https://github.com/snowflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/blob/v2.23.0/docs/index.md#L1209-L1220)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "grants-on-unmanaged-objects"
      }
    },
