      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "External ID Resets\nIf a storage integration is created or\nrecreated without an explicit external ID, it\ngets a new one. The IAM trust policy still\nnames the old one, so every `AssumeRole` call\nfails ([storage integration guide](https://doc\ns.snowflake.com/en/user-guide/data-load-s3-con\nfig-storage-integration)). The apply shows no\nerror: queries and pipes fail afterwards. On\n`snowflake_storage_integration_aws`, a change\nof `name` or `storage_provider` forces such a\nreplacement ([schema](https://github.com/snowf\nlakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/blob/v2.23\n.0/pkg/resources/storage_integration_aws.go#L2\n3-L41)). An `ignore_changes` on the external\nID hides the change from the plan.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-3a9179793f5a",
      "originalText": "External ID Resets\nIf a storage integration is created or recreated without an explicit external ID, it gets a new one. The IAM trust policy still names the old one, so every `AssumeRole` call fails ([storage integration guide](https://docs.snowflake.com/en/user-guide/data-load-s3-config-storage-integration)). The apply shows no error: queries and pipes fail afterwards. On `snowflake_storage_integration_aws`, a change of `name` or `storage_provider` forces such a replacement ([schema](https://github.com/snowflakedb/terraform-provider-snowflake/blob/v2.23.0/pkg/resources/storage_integration_aws.go#L23-L41)). An `ignore_changes` on the external ID hides the change from the plan.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "external-id-resets"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6081685182,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-3270c298ada2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
