      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5883282402,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-3993e91c9dfb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 6613.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 227.5,
      "seed": 591425,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One Role per Duty\nA single Terraform role with MANAGE GRANTS can\ndo everything, so every root module and every\nenvironment shares its blast radius.\nSnowflake's advice splits the work: USERADMIN\nfor users and roles, SECURITYADMIN for grants,\nand SYSADMIN for objects ([access control cons\niderations](https://docs.snowflake.com/en/user\n-guide/security-access-control-considerations)\n). Terraform follows that split with one\nprovider alias for each role. The cost is more\nprovider blocks and more `provider =`\narguments.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-3993e91c9dfb",
      "originalText": "One Role per Duty\nA single Terraform role with MANAGE GRANTS can do everything, so every root module and every environment shares its blast radius. Snowflake's advice splits the work: USERADMIN for users and roles, SECURITYADMIN for grants, and SYSADMIN for objects ([access control considerations](https://docs.snowflake.com/en/user-guide/security-access-control-considerations)). Terraform follows that split with one provider alias for each role. The cost is more provider blocks and more `provider =` arguments.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "one-role-per-duty"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3814355542,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-7ca9dc5f3774",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1309.2,
