    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1309857674,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-7ca9dc5f3774",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 6873.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 227.5,
      "seed": 972628,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Choose the External ID\nWhen you choose the external ID yourself, the\nintegration and the IAM trust policy get it in\nthe same apply. Nobody copies values, and a\nrecreated integration keeps working. When\nSnowflake generates the ID, someone copies it\ninto the trust policy, and every recreate\nbreaks the trust (see External ID Resets). AWS\ndoes not treat an external ID as a secret\n([AWS external ID](https://docs.aws.amazon.com\n/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_common-scenario\ns_third-party.html)), so it can sit in\nconfiguration.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-7ca9dc5f3774",
      "originalText": "Choose the External ID\nWhen you choose the external ID yourself, the integration and the IAM trust policy get it in the same apply. Nobody copies values, and a recreated integration keeps working. When Snowflake generates the ID, someone copies it into the trust policy, and every recreate breaks the trust (see External ID Resets). AWS does not treat an external ID as a secret ([AWS external ID](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/id_roles_common-scenarios_third-party.html)), so it can sit in configuration.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "choose-the-external-id"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9120846341,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-0eb4653c67a4",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1309.2,
      "y": 7133.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
